to make the camera you want to use current.\n\nThe problem right now is that when you select the wrong camera, there are more serious consequences. We definately need to improve the checking here and inform the user properly of what the mistake is. But the fix is the same, make the camera you want to use, current.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6215916314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6225285790","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124532#issuecomment-6225285790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124532","id":6225285790,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcw5Sng","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:45:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:45:05Z","body":"Ah thanks. I'll 